cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MEIDNet Matter, please cite the MEIDNet paper and the software."
title: "MEIDNet Matter: from your materials data to candidate structures"
abstract: "A multimodal inverse-design workbench for crystalline materials. A researcher brings crystal structures and properties; Matter reports what the data and the model support, then runs a constrained, property-conditioned search and returns candidate structures with their evidence and provenance. MEIDNet is the scientific engine."
